WEBVTT

00:18:27.516 --> 00:18:31.916
Many of our happiest people
had quieter lives.

00:18:34.036 --> 00:18:38.916
WPR: And you know, I guess to the tips
that you offered in the talk, you know,

00:18:38.916 --> 00:18:41.756
you talked about how we can build
warm connections,

00:18:41.756 --> 00:18:43.636
steps that we can take.

00:18:43.636 --> 00:18:45.516
And this idea of social fitness.

00:18:46.076 --> 00:18:50.636
And so I'm curious how can we
actually assess our social fitness,

00:18:50.676 --> 00:18:53.836
and as you said, to sort of,
understand what is right for us

00:18:53.876 --> 00:18:56.036
in terms of how many friends to have.

00:18:56.036 --> 00:18:59.796
And is it possible
to sustain warm relationships

00:18:59.836 --> 00:19:03.916
if you aren't really intentional
in thinking about your social fitness?